s busy yet organized; fluorescent lights illuminate high ceilings where pipes run along walls, giving it an authentic, working-class atmosphere typical of a modern fabrication facility.\n\n---\n\n**Scene Transition & Scene 2: Luxury Showroom Presentation**\n\nThere’s a quick transition—a blur effect—to shift from the gritty reality of production to sleek elegance:\n  \n**Scene 3: Modern Living Room Setting**\n- This scene opens up into a luxurious showroom designed to mimic a contemporary home interior.\n- At its center stands a brown leather sofa set against a massive digital projection wall displaying serene coastal scenery under starry skies—an immersive visual backdrop enhancing ambiance.\n- In front lies a minimalist white oval coffee table holding decorative items such as golden figurines.\n- To either side are additional seating options including beige modular couches and vibrant orange chairs arranged symmetrically around the central piece.\n- Lighting fixtures above cast warm tones across polished marble floors, creating inviting shadows and highlighting textures throughout the room.\n- Prominently featured again is the MINOCCHI branding alongside Chinese characters (“米诺奇”) projected onto the scenic wallpaper-like surface behind the main sofa.\n- Other smaller screens subtly show glimpses of different models within adjacent rooms — hinting at multi-room customization possibilities offered by the company.\n\n---\n\nOverall, this video serves dual purposes:\n1) It showcases craftsmanship via candid footage of artisans operating heavy-duty machines during early stages of development;\n2) Then transitions smoothly into showcasing finished products placed elegantly within aspirational living spaces meant to inspire potential buyers’ imaginations.\n\nIt effectively bridges technical expertise with aesthetic appeal—the core message being that every premium item comes not just out-of-a-box but crafted thoughtfully by dedicated professionals who care deeply about quality and style.", "en", "zh", "2d8724b5548f35f30e65dda8de3d9f0a.AXQo0xNmGDq1ma26", "glm-4-flash-250414", 0.1, 0.7, 2048, 606751399990058, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text_input"}, "name": "text_input", "link": 6, "label": "text_input", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text_input"}, {"widget": {"name": "from_language"}, "name": "from_language", "label": "from_language", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "from_language"}, {"widget": {"name": "to_language"}, "name": "to_language", "label": "to_language", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "to_language"}, {"widget": {"name": "api_key"}, "name": "api_key", "label": "api_key", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "api_key"}, {"widget": {"name": "model_name"}, "name": "model_name", "label": "model_name", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "model_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "top_p"}, "name": "top_p", "label": "top_p", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "top_p"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_tokens"}, "name": "max_tokens", "label": "max_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "id": 4, "type": "GLM_Translation_Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "GLM_Translation_Text"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [5, 6], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [408.5826110839844, 393.8163757324219], "pos": [84.70402526855469, -33.23490524291992], "widgets_values": ["Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct", "None (FP16)", "Describe this image in detail.", "你是一名专业的图片分析大师，你非常擅长分析用户上传的图片文件，并根据提示返回最终要求。\n1：先详细分析用户输入的图片{{input}}，详细分析图片在人物的样貌、着装、饰物、动作、表情、妆容等等细节，只分析主要人物就可以，请忽略背景其他元素。\n2：在遇到描写发型发色的部分替换为（参考图一，发色不要太夸张，可以适当降低浓度）\n3：请完美复刻并详细描述主要人物的整体着装，（例如包括饰物、路肩上衣，镂空套裙、包股裙子、丝袜等等，不包括手持的物件